<h2>设置</h2>

<form method="post" action="/api/config/general" hx-post="/api/config/general" hx-target="#gen-msg">
  <article>
    <h3>通用</h3>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="autoIncludeNewPlaylists" value="1" <%= cfg.general.autoIncludeNewPlaylists ? 'checked' : '' %>> 自动纳入 LX 新建的歌单（默认：同名文件夹+同名 <%= targetName %> 歌单）</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="cleanupOrphanFiles" value="1" <%= cfg.general.cleanupOrphanFiles ? 'checked' : '' %>> 完全同步时清理无引用的孤立文件（默认关）</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="pauseAll" value="1" <%= cfg.general.pauseAll ? 'checked' : '' %>> 暂停所有同步（总开关）</label>
    <div class="row-inline">
      <div><label>日志保留天数<input type="number" name="logRetentionDays" value="<%= cfg.general.logRetentionDays %>" min="1" max="365"></label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span>帮助链接（GitHub）</span><input name="githubUrl" value="<%= cfg.general.githubUrl %>" placeholder="https://github.com/xxx/songferry" style="width:24rem"></div>
      <p class="hint">显示在左侧栏底部"帮助"入口</p>
    </div>
    <p><button type="submit" class="btn-sm">保存</button> <span id="gen-msg"></span></p>
  </article>
</form>

<article>
  <h3>账号安全</h3>
  <form method="post" action="/api/auth/settings" hx-post="/api/auth/settings" hx-target="#auth-msg">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem">
      <input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <%= cfg.auth.enabled ? 'checked' : '' %>> 启用账号认证（登录后访问）
    </label>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span>用户名</span><input name="username" value="<%= cfg.auth.username %>" placeholder="admin" style="width:14rem"></div>
    </div>
    <% if (cfg.auth.enabled) { %>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span>当前密码</span><input type="password" name="currentPassword" placeholder="修改账号需验证"></div>
      <p class="hint">已启用状态下修改/停用需要验证当前密码</p>
    </div>
    <% } %>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span><%= cfg.auth.enabled ? '新密码（留空=不改）' : '新密码' %></span><input type="password" name="newPassword" placeholder=""></div>
      <p class="hint">密码以 scrypt 哈希存储，不保存明文；启用时必填</p>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存账号设置</button>
      <span id="auth-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
  </form>
</article>

<article>
  <h3>批量下载保护</h3>
  <form method="post" action="/api/config/protection" hx-post="/api/config/protection" hx-target="#prot-msg">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem">
      <input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <%= cfg.download.protection.enabled ? 'checked' : '' %>> 批量下载保护（推荐开启）
    </label>
    <p class="hint" style="margin-top:.2rem">下载保持单任务串行，并在每首歌曲成功或失败后等待一段时间；同时限制直链解析的请求节奏，降低音源限流或封禁 IP 的风险。</p>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span>下载间隔（秒）</span><input type="number" name="downloadIntervalSec" value="<%= cfg.download.protection.downloadIntervalSec %>" min="2" max="60"></div>
      <p class="hint">范围 2~60 秒，默认 5 秒；成功和失败的任务都会等待</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prot-field">
      <div class="row1"><span>直链解析间隔（秒）</span><input type="number" name="resolveIntervalSec" value="<%= cfg.download.protection.resolveIntervalSec %>" min="1" max="30"></div>
      <p class="hint">范围 1~30 秒，默认 2 秒；只限制新的直链解析请求</p>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">
      当前已<%= cfg.download.protection.enabled ? '开启：下载间隔 ' + cfg.download.protection.downloadIntervalSec + ' 秒，直链解析间隔 ' + cfg.download.protection.resolveIntervalSec + ' 秒' : '关闭' %>
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存保护设置</button>
      <span id="prot-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
  </form>
  <details>
    <summary>批量下载保护说明</summary>
    <ul class="hint">
      <li>下载任务始终按队列逐个执行，不会并发请求多个音源。</li>
      <li>间隔从上一首下载完成或失败后开始计算，等待期间下一首不会发起请求。</li>
      <li>直链解析间隔会错开连续的解析请求（换音质档位或自动重试时同样受控），避免短时间快速连发。</li>
      <li>关闭保护会取消两个间隔，但下载仍保持串行；频繁请求可能触发音源平台限流或封禁 IP。</li>
      <li>保存后影响后续请求，不会中断当前正在下载的任务。</li>
    </ul>
  </details>
</article>

<article>
  <h3>通知（预留）</h3>
  <p class="hint">通知功能规划中：飞书 webhook 配置将在后续版本开放。</p>
  <label>飞书 Webhook（占位）<input disabled placeholder="https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxx"></label>
</article>

<article>
  <h3>高级设置</h3>
  <form method="post" action="/api/config/advanced" hx-post="/api/config/advanced" hx-target="#adv-msg">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem">
      <input type="checkbox" name="dedupCheck" value="1" id="adv-dd" onchange="toggleAdvQ()" <%= cfg.advanced.dedupCheck ? 'checked' : '' %>> 同步前查重
    </label>
    <p class="hint" style="margin-top:.2rem">默认关闭，开启后每首歌都需查一次 <%= targetName %>，耗时增加</p>
    <p class="hint" style="margin-top:.2rem">同步歌单前先检查 <%= targetName %> 曲库：已存在对应歌曲则跳过该曲的 LX 搜索下载，仅执行歌单加入（全库查重）。适用于"库中已有高音质不想重复下载"的场景。</p>
    <div class="prot-field" id="adv-dedup-q" style="display:<%= cfg.advanced.dedupCheck ? '' : 'none' %>">
      <div class="row1"><span>查重音质门槛</span>
        <select name="dedupMinQuality" style="width:16rem">
          <option value="">不检查音质（任意存在即跳过）</option>
          <% for (const q of qOrder) { %>
          <option value="<%= q %>" <%= cfg.advanced.dedupMinQuality === q ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= qLabels[q] %></option>
          <% } %>
        </select>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">库内已有音质 ≥ 所选档位 → 跳过下载；低于所选（如只有 320k）→ 视为缺失，继续下载高音质</p>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button type="submit">保存高级设置</button>
      <span id="adv-msg" class="msg"></span>
    </div>
  </form>
</article>
<article>
  <h3>运行信息</h3>
  <p class="hint">
    配置: <code>data/config.yaml</code> ｜ 数据库: <code>data/songferry.db</code><br>
    Emby 媒体库 Id: <code><%= cfg.emby.mediaLibraryId || '未探测' %></code>
  </p>
</article>
<script>
function toggleAdvQ() {
  var el = document.getElementById('adv-dd')
  var q = document.getElementById('adv-dedup-q')
  if (q) q.style.display = el.checked ? '' : 'none'
}
</script>
